Application **26/01501/FUL** is for a **change of use to a cafe** at **9 Tannery Close**.

Its current status is **awaiting validation**, which means the council has received the application but has not yet checked it is complete and ready to be publicly consulted on. As a result, there are no consultation closing date or decision due date set yet.

As a neighbour, you will normally be notified by letter once the application is validated and consultation begins. At that point you'll be able to view the plans and submit comments within the consultation period. Comments should focus on material planning considerations such as noise, opening hours, parking, odours and impact on the surrounding area.

I can't give a view on whether the proposal is acceptable. If you'd like to know whether any constraints apply to the property, such as a conservation area or listed building status, I can check that for the address.
